msgstr "Bestätige deine E-Mail-Adresse"

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:65
msgid "Your next connection starts here"
msgstr "Hier beginnt dein nächster Kontakt"

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:66
msgid "From your profile to a useful conversation"
msgstr "Vom Profil zum hilfreichen Gespräch"

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:68
#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:77
msgid "Describe your offer and your goal"
msgstr "Beschreibe dein Angebot und dein Ziel"

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:68
msgid "One concrete need and one way you can help are enough to start."
msgstr ""
"Ein konkreter Bedarf und ein Angebot, wie du helfen kannst, reichen für "
"den Anfang."

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:69
#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:75
msgid "Choose your visibility"
msgstr "Entscheide über deine Sichtbarkeit"

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:69
msgid "Directory visibility and matching are separate, optional choices."
msgstr ""
"Sichtbarkeit im Verzeichnis und Matching sind getrennte, freiwillige "
"Entscheidungen."

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:70
#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:73
msgid "Explore your matches"
msgstr "Entdecke passende Kontakte"

#: app/templates/member/dashboard.html:70
msgid "Read why someone fits, then request an introduction."
msgstr "Lies, warum jemand passt, und frage dann einen Kontakt an."

#: app/templates/modules/profile_matches.html:7
msgid "Matching navigation"
msgstr "Matching-Navigation"

#: app/templates/public/index.html:10
msgid "Pause background animation"
msgstr "Hintergrundanimation pausieren"

#: app/templates/public/index.html:43
msgid "Explore the club"
msgstr "Entdecke den Club"

